  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_78ebd2b20f014b70b18631589369e802",
      "statement": "The deployed system is a single Rust binary: the Cargo workspace has exactly one member (`server`), and its `main` builds one Axum `Router` served on one TCP address that handles the JSON API, uploaded images, documents, and the embedded SPA, with no separate worker, external DB, or frontend web server.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Cargo.toml#L1-L3",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:277c807ab71d3c6b3b2bf998aa77650f3d2f8b626439e86a703765f1d9d1bc29:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/main.rs#L45-L61",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e1c8034695dfcc9234f5aa139e22b7404bf530aadcdb4fa9a7db776d9c19ea6c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c48ca29643a84532a9c4f478488fa9bb",
      "statement": "`main.rs` mounts exactly four runtime domains on the router in this order: `.nest(\"/api/v1\", routes::api_routes(pool))`, `.nest_service(\"/images\", ServeDir::new(image_dir))`, `.nest_service(\"/docs\", ServeDir::new(docs_dir))`, and `.fallback(static_files::handler)` for the compile-time embedded SPA, wrapped by `DefaultBodyLimit::max(100 * 1024 * 1024)`, `CorsLayer::permissive()`, and `TraceLayer::new_for_http()`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/main.rs#L45-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:08c99ca09c589ba8d485eb7ebde9b440efef5c5dab908b73c3312ae671707f55:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b49e48384f404f5eb70d4993f24d8b43",
      "statement": "Any request that matches no registered route — including a misspelled path under `/api/v1` — reaches `static_files::handler`, which returns `index.html` with status 200 (so unknown API paths surface as HTML, not a JSON 404); only a registered path with the wrong method yields 405.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/main.rs#L45-L50",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e3e22d9e297e38f2520954322d7831c67f834d752b1ef19cf840644a04a2415e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/static_files.rs#L12-L29",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1e71838b3a72803c57363d4cdbba9746254974f53fbad01069e9e2f8c8af4cef:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b3fb1b0734a540e597bfed53f6b0eb8a",
      "statement": "Startup is fail-fast: `main` creates `image_dir/items` and `image_dir/containers`, initialises the migrated pool, runs a full FTS `sync_all` (the only non-fatal step — failure is logged as a warning), creates `docs_dir/pdf`, then binds and serves; every other failure goes through `expect` and aborts the process, and `axum::serve` has no graceful shutdown so in-flight requests are dropped on termination.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/main.rs#L17-L61",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:54f0d51fec5cc9b44d7266f6cfa774c3115a55abee03589598ac55194727bb4f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_55b9661f02f2432493da724edaa2e344",
      "statement": "`db::init` creates the DB file's parent directory, opens a SQLite pool with `max_connections(5)` and `create_if_missing(true)`, and runs the migrations embedded via `sqlx::migrate!(\"./migrations\")` on every startup, panicking if they fail — so restarting the binary is the automatic schema-repair mechanism.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/db.rs#L4-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8480baba3c3811ae9194358c2a05b528a5efa00fa363307e842eb7c9cdf0cc62:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4fa82b6f8fef44dfb343bdb67a308ab8",
      "statement": "`Config::load` resolves configuration from the TOML file at `$CONFIG_PATH` (default `config.toml`, relative to the working directory) when it exists, otherwise `Config::default()`, then applies `--host` / `--port` / `--help` CLI overrides and exits with status 1 on an unknown argument.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/config.rs#L45-L97",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7fca61e409bdfb8f66058cee4311c0b7fc4d704ea84b5e7b45dfeb8f5680f46f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a5ae3e403f8f49108e4cb9fe4d09558c",
      "statement": "Default data location is `$XDG_DATA_HOME/wheremystuff` when set, else `$HOME/.local/share/wheremystuff`, else the relative directory `data`, holding `wheremystuff.db`, `images`, and `docs`; the default server bind is `127.0.0.1:3000`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/config.rs#L119-L138",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6edb071b48fcf4bda2066add89c09cb7c6bba1e36b47768b01d58a319b11c864:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/config.rs#L4-L12",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:af41490c98c92a22e0817a0b7ed03cb85a8b39cdb7a34fb6bed7eabe48265acb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_20e9c9db0dad494181beec0a3f06a4a5",
      "statement": "Upload limits are strings parsed at use time: `upload.max_file_size` defaults to `\"10MB\"`, `upload.max_doc_size` is optional and defaults to `\"50MB\"`, `parse_size` accepts KB/MB/GB, treats a missing or unknown unit as MB, and falls back to 10 for an unparseable number.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/config.rs#L34-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:16a380eedcf1f4e28c00df0a5e3dc6ac5790bb4d31856fd6cac51c140890949a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/config.rs#L99-L117",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8a662a3fce9ae381f097723a7abbdf18c29463005469e3f4bc201f3b933b4974:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_17d97ae6cb7c4e6e953b86f58cb46e39",
      "statement": "The Axum state is only the `SqlitePool`; configuration is not shared state, because the image and document handlers call `crate::config::Config::load()` inside the request path and therefore re-read `config.toml` from disk per request, while the `ServeDir` mounts, DB path, and bound address were fixed at boot from the earlier load.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server/src/handlers/container.rs#L103-L110",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1063272669729eba9d52c15ca4e1002db343acd385c0aec2d2660c8d1d6d9208:"
