    {
      "id": "claim_51b4f67dc2ae46a39a3ca920ba361d01",
      "statement": "Uploaded media is addressed by DB-stored paths relative to `image_dir` / `docs_dir`, mounted at `/images` and `/docs`; the SPA composes `/images/{thumb_path|file_path}` and `/docs/pdf/{file_path}`, but `web/vite.config.ts` proxies only `/api` and the legacy `/data/images`, so image and document URLs resolve only when pages are served by the Rust binary, not through the Vite dev server.",
