    {
      "id": "claim_58901bded020418281b21f7b2206c3fa",
      "statement": "No automated tests protect the server: `server/tests/` is empty, no module contains `#[cfg(test)]`, and the `reqwest`/`tempfile` dev-dependencies are unused, so `cargo test -p server` runs zero tests and the enforced gates are `cargo clippy`, prettier check, and the frontend `tsc -b`.",
