    {
      "id": "claim_f8b95ed06232414291d573780bbded0c",
      "statement": "Module structure is deliberately parallel per domain: `handlers/`, `repositories/`, and `models/` each contain `category`, `container`, `item`, `tag` (plus `search`/`stats` variants), `services/` holds only `image` and `search_index`, and `routes.rs` is the only place a domain becomes reachable over HTTP.",
